WEBVTT

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:15.360
"I can't overcome it"  "I'm annoyed"

00:00:16.010 --> 00:00:20.100
Even if I break down those hurdles

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:28.310
No answer emerges

00:00:28.310 --> 00:00:34.810
Am I being controlled?  Everyone on the field

00:00:34.810 --> 00:00:39.750
Isn't scared, go away, but...

00:00:39.750 --> 00:00:43.450
The unseen road to the future

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Cannot be chosen

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.500
Close your eyes and cut with your heart

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.160
just like cards, surely

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:03.230
It was promised  yes!  you are the winner

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.100
never lose!  Cut with your heart

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.330
just like cards, surely

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:16.680
Because a miracle will occur

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.000
Bonds

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:48.440
All right!

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.850
Wow!  Awesome!

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:53.170
Hey!  You're blocking traffic!

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:54.370
Outta my way!

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:57.310
What are they doing in the middle of the street?

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:01.180
Sorry, but you have to take a detour.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.500
Why?

00:02:03.000 --> 00:02:08.240
Due to Kaiba Corporation's event, we're restricting traffic in the city.  Sorry.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:11.870
Traffic is restricted because of a single event?

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:15.860
Because Kaiba Corporation is headquarted in this city.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.250
This is crazy!

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.250
Well, they got permission.

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.300
Drive back.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:22.660
Hey!

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:26.140
Kaiba, Kaiba...  He thinks he's sooo great.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.210
Brother, we're nearing Domino Pier.

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:45.210
Everyone, please be safe.

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:51.280
The Ghoul who's after the God Cards is named Marik, right?

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:57.960
He has The Winged Dragon of Ra.  How much do you know about him?

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:04.700
I've never seen him.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:09.470
But I know he has a Millennium Item, just like me.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.700
How dumb.  You're talking about those occult items again.

00:03:14.030 --> 00:03:19.440
Kaiba, you experienced the power of Pegasus's Millennium Item firsthand.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.960
I attack with Bickuribox!

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:41.640
Farewell, Mokuba.  Farewell, Yugi.

00:03:50.240 --> 00:03:55.510
Since you have no cards left, you lose.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.920
You will share the same fate as Mokuba boy!

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.920
Mind Card!

00:04:09.510 --> 00:04:13.130
I sealed your mind inside this card.

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:19.380
You'll now become my obedient servant and serve me.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.510
That was a trick!

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.520
It's up to you whether you believe me or not.

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:37.020
But I'm the soul sealed inside the Millennium Puzzle.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:43.030
Right now, I'm both Yugi and not Yugi.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:50.000
Yugi Muto woke me when he completed the Millennium Puzzle.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:54.400
No way!  If you're not Yugi, who are you?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.740
Probably...

00:04:57.220 --> 00:05:01.840
The soul of the Pharaoh, erased from ancient Egyptian history.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:03.510
Pharaoh?

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:04.910
Pharaoh...

00:05:08.650 --> 00:05:10.250
That woman...

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:16.530
Ishizu showed me a stone tablet at Domino Museum.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.050
What?

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:26.900
They're Duel Monsters!

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:27.670
Correct.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:33.980
Pegasus created Duel Monsters based on this mural.

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.330
Take a look at this other mural.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:41.160
This is what I wanted to show you.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:45.060
That's...

00:05:45.160 --> 00:05:46.360
Yugi!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:50.590
And above him is Dark Magician!

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:56.630
Inscribed here is the Pharaoh of the 18th dynasty.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.070
Pharaoh?

00:05:58.070 --> 00:06:02.880
But someone has scratched his name off.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:09.330
Only this Pharaoh has been erased from ancient Egyptian history.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.130
The nameless Pharaoh from 3,000 years ago.

00:06:14.460 --> 00:06:16.520
That's what you have to say?

00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:22.530
Ishizu must have planted some weird ideas into your mind too.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.760
No.  What Ishizu told me was...

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:33.950
An enemy with a new Millennium Item will appear before you soon.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:37.100
And he showed up.

00:06:42.930 --> 00:06:44.880
I was waiting for this moment!

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:46.850
I flip over my trap card!

00:06:47.280 --> 00:06:49.080
Chain Destruction!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:55.590
Vanish!

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.010
No way...

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:05.210
My Exodia...

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:13.240
Help me.  He's coming...

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:16.000
The Millennium Item's symbol!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:19.550
Marik is coming...

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.960
It's been a while, Yugi.

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:31.560
The strongest duelist who defeated Pegasus.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:35.940
Oops.  Sorry to surprise you.

00:07:35.940 --> 00:07:39.070
You're not currently talking to this man.

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:44.180
I'm in a different location from where you are.

00:07:44.500 --> 00:07:51.520
I implanted my memories inside him, so I can control him whenever I want.

00:07:51.820 --> 00:07:53.200
Who are you?

00:07:53.500 --> 00:07:57.860
I've been chosen by a Millennium Item, just like you.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:02.600
All this power comes from my Millennium Rod.

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.800
Millennium Rod?

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.630
This show was how I say hello.

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:12.060
My name is Marik.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.370
Marik!

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:23.820
Dark Magician Girl, attack Pandora directly!

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.220
Black Burning!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:36.430
Why do you want to kill us?  Answer me!

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:39.430
I‘m not interested in you.

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.930
I'm after the soul inside the vessel!

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.450
Revenge.

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:48.650
The family of gravekeepers has lived in the shadows for 3,000 years.

00:08:48.650 --> 00:08:50.650
Their descendants want revenge!

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:59.150
Since ancient times, my family was destined to protect the Valley of the Kings and the Millennium Items.

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.420
And then...

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.680
Everyone died obeying their destiny.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:09.620
Their duty was to return the Pharaoh's memories when he resurrected.

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:11.530
Memories?

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:17.500
Do you have anything to do with the seven Items that must be placed in the tablet of the Pharaoh's memories?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:21.460
Yes.  I have one of those Items.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:27.600
I must protect it with my life until I can present it to the Pharaoh's soul.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:30.350
That was taught to me since I was young.

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:34.300
The question is: Where is the Pharaoh's soul?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:41.060
The best way to find out is written in the ancient Egyptian text Prt M Hrw.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.400
It says the three God Cards will point to the Pharaoh.

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:50.770
So the one who gathers the three God Cards will become the Pharaoh.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:55.300
He will have the seven Millennium Items and regain the lost memories.

00:09:55.480 --> 00:09:57.530
Three God Cards?

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.540
The lost memories!

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:08.050
To end our cursed destiny, I must get revenge on the Pharaoh's soul and kill him again.

00:10:08.680 --> 00:10:12.050
And if the God Cards point to the Pharaoh...

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:18.060
I will become the new Pharaoh when I acquire all the cards!

00:10:22.700 --> 00:10:27.460
Collecting the three God Cards isn't Marik's only goal.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:31.870
His real goal is to kill me, the Pharaoh's soul.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:11:01.080
The fight has lasted for 3,000 years since ancient Egypt?

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:05.140
That's how you and the Ghouls are connected?

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.310
Don't take him seriously, Mokuba.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:12.550
Yugi, you expect me to believe such an unscientific story?

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:17.290
But Kaiba, you saw it with your own eyes.

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:37.440
I can't win.

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.270
There's no way to defeat Slifer.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:44.970
Get up, Yugi!

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.750
A duelist like you won't lose here!

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:52.250
Kaiba!

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:57.260
If a God stands in your way, knock God down!

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:04.300
Understood, Kaiba!

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:05.270
Just wait!

00:12:05.840 --> 00:12:08.970
I'll now defeat a God!

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:14.820
Buster Blader, attack Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:17.810
Dragon Buster Blade!

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.690
This is my trump card!

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:26.900
The spell card Brain Control!

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:36.500
I summon it on my field!

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.710
What happens next?

00:12:44.950 --> 00:12:48.290
Revival Jam resurrects again.

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:51.860
Oh no!

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:56.760
Slifer's effect will activate again and destroy Revival Jam.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:13:02.990
Then it'll resurrect, force me to draw three cards, and Slifer will attack again!

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.730
This will repeat forever.

00:13:05.940 --> 00:13:07.620
It's an infinite loop!

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:12.630
If you can't draw a card from your deck, you can't continue the game.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.240
I win, Marik!

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.320
All right!  Yugi won!

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.790
Yugi.

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.790
You still don't want to let the God Card go?

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:38.960
You don't know when to give up, Marik.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:45.200
I can easily get the God Card back if I involve your friends.

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:50.400
The Ghouls' Rare Hunters have been watching your friends all this time.

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.770
I can use them anytime I want.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:55.310
That's dirty, Marik!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.250
It's your fault.

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:02.750
If you lost, your friends wouldn't be in danger.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.450
Also...

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.900
Vanish, you wimp!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:18.770
God Hand Crusher!

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.460
Marik!

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.660
Ma...ri...

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.320
What?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.300
His personality changed.

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:47.630
Yeah.  Someone else is controlling him.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:49.630
No way!  By who?

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.200
By the Ghouls's leader, Marik.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:55.070
He has the third God Card.

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.740
The Winged Dragon of Ra's owner?

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:02.160
Nice to meet you, Kaiba.

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:12.060
It's psychologically possible to brainwash and control a person.

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:16.500
It's fine if you don't believe.

00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:21.730
But it's a fact that the Ghouls took Jonouchi and my friends.

00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.230
I will rescue them!

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:28.530
Jonouchi, this is your card.

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:35.480
Yugi, I can't take that Red-Eyes right now.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:46.490
If I accept that card so easily, I feel like I'll be further away from becoming a true duelist.

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:48.540
True duelist...

00:15:48.940 --> 00:15:54.400
You won fair and square against a cheater without compromising your principles.

00:15:54.880 --> 00:15:58.130
I learned a lot from you again.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.580
You have a duelist's pride that I don't have.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:06.120
For me, Red-Eyes is an irreplaceable card.

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:09.400
My partner and I have fought together until now.

00:16:09.800 --> 00:16:12.010
That's why I can't take it.

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:15.950
Red-Eyes won't approve of how I am.

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:21.120
So Yugi, take care of that card for now.

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:26.400
I want to become a true duelist.

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:30.520
No, not "want."  I "will" become a true duelist during Battle City.

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:39.640
Yugi, when I keep winning and become a true duelist, I want you to duel me again.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:42.650
Okay.

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:45.580
Let's duel when that time comes, Jonouchi.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.140
Thank you, Yugi.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.950
Jonouchi, I'll wait for you.

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:57.510
I'll hold on to your Red-Eyes until then.

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:06.050
And to become a true duelist, you deliberately chose to fight in difficult duels.

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:08.230
Here I go!

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:11.340
I attack with two monsters during my Battle Phase!

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:17.410
Alligator's Sword, deal him damage with your Dragon Sword!

00:17:23.130 --> 00:17:25.290
Go, Swordsman of Landstar!

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.520
This attack will end the duel!

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:30.720
One can pass, but not the other!

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:32.660
I flip over my trap card!

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:34.980
I activate Mind Control!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:37.960
Trap card?

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:49.340
The monster caught by this trap become my servant for two turns!

00:17:49.930 --> 00:17:55.380
I tribute Swordsman of Landstar to summon Jinzo!

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:00.620
The Equip Card Amplifier!

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:03.480
I equip it on Jinzo!

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:07.060
Jinzo gains 500 attack points!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:10.960
What?

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.640
Jinzo, attack!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.400
Cyber Energy Shock!

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.060
It's your turn, Jonouchi.

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:32.420
You still have time to surrender.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:35.200
Surrender?  Whatever!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.890
I'll never give up!

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:39.190
Attack, my Queen!

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.430
Queen's Hell Breath!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:50.340
Panther Warrior is destroyed!

00:18:54.570 --> 00:19:00.300
Is this ugly monster sealing my fate?

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:03.250
Hang in there, Jonouchi!  Don't give up!

00:19:03.770 --> 00:19:07.690
I don't know how to get out of this.

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:11.720
Jonouchi, it's not like you to give up!

00:19:12.230 --> 00:19:17.110
I thought you were going to become a true duelist and duel Yugi!

00:19:17.110 --> 00:19:18.660
A true duelist!

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:24.100
Jonouchi, I'll hold on to this card until then.

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.460
That's right.

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:30.780
I promised Yugi and Red-Eyes that when I became a true duelist...

00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:33.710
Let's duel when that time comes.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.550
Hang in there, Jonouchi!

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:41.260
Don't let bug boy beat you!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:42.350
Jonouchi!

00:19:42.640 --> 00:19:45.000
Jonouchi!

00:19:45.280 --> 00:19:46.710
I won't give up.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:49.330
I will find an opening!

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:53.840
Fortress Whale is sunk!

00:19:57.150 --> 00:19:58.370
All right!

00:19:58.370 --> 00:19:59.010
Way to go!

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:00.620
How's that, Kajiki?

00:20:00.620 --> 00:20:04.680
Jonouchi, my turn isn't over yet.

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.850
I play the spell card Return of the Doomed.

00:20:08.170 --> 00:20:11.280
It resurrects the monster that was destroyed this turn.

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:13.220
That means...

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.960
Fortress Whale will return.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.160
It's all over.

00:20:20.320 --> 00:20:22.770
What's up?  Come at me!

00:20:22.770 --> 00:20:27.680
You talk a big game, so show me how you fight!

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:30.870
I can't afford to lose either.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:34.400
There's a battle that I want to fight.

00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:36.400
I won't give up!

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:40.210
I activate a spell card!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:42.340
Giant Trunade!

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:50.890
What?

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:55.310
I'm not willing to leave this card in the graveyard.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:59.000
I have no regrets!

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:00.330
Bring it, Jonouchi!

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:02.500
Panther Warrior attacks!

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:15.950
I won't let the Ghouls trample all over your spirit!

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:18.680
I can see Domino Pier!

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:25.590
Wait for me, Jonouchi!

00:21:42.460 --> 00:21:48.750
Brainwashed by Marik into believing that Yugi is the enemy, Jonouchi waits for Yugi at Domino Pier.

00:21:49.030 --> 00:21:54.200
Jonouchi challenges Yugi to a death duel where the loser will lose his life.

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:55.890
Stop it, you two!

00:21:55.890 --> 00:22:02.400
We left for Duelist Kingdom from this pier, but we're now having a cruel battle here?

00:22:03.600 --> 00:22:07.430
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Heartless Duel
Yugi vs Jonouchi

00:22:07.430 --> 00:22:08.860
Duel, standby!

00:22:22.930 --> 00:22:27.430
Even a long, long time ago

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:32.810
I feel like I've been here

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:42.460
The setting sun colors the classroom after school

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:53.970
We all laugh as you point out that I cut my bangs too short

00:22:56.860 --> 00:23:01.500
Time passes bit by bit

00:23:02.160 --> 00:23:06.770
The time when my bangs touch my eyelids

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:11.880
Will never change

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:17.150
The sunset envelops everyone

00:23:17.780 --> 00:23:22.350
To be who I am

00:23:22.950 --> 00:23:27.590
I've kept searching for something

00:23:28.250 --> 00:23:32.300
The time that we're now spending together

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:35.240
I learned that's the answer

00:23:36.030 --> 00:23:42.340
From now until forever...
